🎉 PHP 8.6.0 Alpha 3 is available for testing!

This continues the PHP 8.6 release cycle, featuring:

- Partial Function Application
- New IO copy API for faster stream copying
- Re-enable JIT for ZTS builds on Apple Silicon
- Removed the dependency on the ICU IO library
- Several GMP improvements

… and more!

✅ Test your projects
❌ Not for production

